    {
      "name": "1 · Single-resource migration (sync)",
      "description": "Migrate ONE resource type, scoped to the sourceIds you list. Each blocks and returns the job + report. Add `?async=true` for fire-and-forget.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Migrate apis (sync)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"companyName\": \"{{companyName}}\",\n  \"wso2Tenant\": \"{{wso2Tenant}}\",\n  \"userEmail\": \"{{userEmail}}\",\n  \"requestSource\": \"{{requestSource}}\",\n  \"requestTransactionId\": \"{{txnId}}\",\n  \"kongCtrlPlanId\": \"{{kongCtrlPlanId}}\",\n  \"kongRegion\": \"{{kongRegion}}\",\n  \"apis\": [\n    \"{{apiSourceId}}\"\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/konnect/wso2/apis",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "konnect",
                "wso2",
                "apis"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Migrate selected APIs → Kong services + routes + plugins** — only the selected `apis` (by WSO2 sourceId).\n\n`kongCtrlPlanId` + `kongRegion` are required because the account has multiple control planes (omit → error *\"Multiple Kong control planes found\"*).\n\n**Sync vs async:** this runs **synchronously** (blocks, returns the job + full report). Add `?async=true` to the URL to return immediately with a PENDING job, then poll **Track a job → Get status / Get report**."
          },
          "response": []
        },
